// Security events (event ids 1000-1999, see Logging.md) per day and event id, the last 8 days. Counts only.
AppTraces
| where _ResourceId endswith "/components/moduleregistry" and TimeGenerated > ago(8d)
| extend EventId = toint(Properties.EventId)
| where EventId between (1000 .. 1999)
| summarize Count = count() by Day = bin(TimeGenerated, 1d), EventId
| order by Day desc, EventId asc